{
  "name": "npd_VEINHasher",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "Generates a secure, hashed representation of an Employer Identification Number (EIN).",
  "longDescription": "An Employer Identification Number (EIN) is a unique 9-digit federal tax identification number assigned by the IRS to businesses operating within the United States. This project provides a secure and standardized hashing mechanism for EINs so downstream systems can verify and reference EINs without directly storing sensitive identifiers. It is intended for use in operational pipelines where privacy and security controls require strong hashing for regulated data elements.",
